{'symbol': 'ITW', 'date': '2019-11-19 22:30:00', 'title': 'ALPHA ASSEMBLY SOLUTIONS, INC. ENTERED INTO AN AGREEMENT TO ACQUIRE KESTER INC. FROM ILLINOIS TOOL WORKS INC. (NYSE:ITW).', 'text': 'ALPHA ASSEMBLY SOLUTIONS, INC. ENTERED INTO AN AGREEMENT TO ACQUIRE KESTER INC. FROM ILLINOIS TOOL WORKS INC. (NYSE:ITW) ON NOVEMBER 20, 2019. ELEMENT SOLUTIONS INC (NYSE:ESI), PARENT OF ALPHA ASSEMBLY SOLUTIONS, INC., WILL MAKE KESTER A PART OF THE MACDERMID ALPHA BUSINESS. THE TRANSACTION WILL CLOSE EFFECTIVE DECEMBER 2, 2019.\n'}